<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Mis Enlaces • Blox_sii</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #050508;
            background-image: 
                radial-gradient(circle at 10% 15%, rgba(0, 150, 255, 0.35) 0%, transparent 45%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 90% 85%, rgba(0, 255, 120, 0.3) 0%, transparent 45%);
            color: #ffffff;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px;
            background-attachment: fixed;
        }

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 400px;
            background: rgba(15, 15, 25, 0.65);
            backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 204, 0.2);
            border-radius: 28px;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), 0 0 20px rgba(0, 255, 204, 0.1);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .profile-pic {
            width: 105px;
            height: 105px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 2px solid #00ffcc;
            object-fit: cover;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 255, 204, 0.5);
            background-color: #111;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        p.bio {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #a0a0c0;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .links-list {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 14px;
        }

        .link-btn {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            padding: 15px 18px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .link-content {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .icon {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }

        .arrow {
            color: #888;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        /* Efectos al presionar / hover */
        .link-btn.whatsapp:hover, .link-btn.whatsapp:active {
            background: rgba(0, 255, 120, 0.15);
            border-color: #00ff78;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 255, 120, 0.3);
        }

        .link-btn.discord:hover, .link-btn.discord:active {
            background: rgba(88, 101, 242, 0.2);
            border-color: #5865F2;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(88, 101, 242, 0.3);
        }

        .link-btn.roblox:hover, .link-btn.roblox:active {
            background: rgba(0, 150, 255, 0.2);
            border-color: #0096ff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 150, 255, 0.3);
        }

        .link-btn:hover .arrow {
            transform: translateX(4px);
            color: #fff;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 25px;
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            color: #666;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <!-- Foto de perfil actualizada -->
        <img src="https://i.ibb.co/Z618q4bP/SAVE-20261018-014101.jpg" alt="Avatar Blox_sii" class="profile-pic">
        
        <h1>Blox_sii</h1>
        <p class="bio">🚀 ¡Bienvenido a mi comunidad! Únete a mis redes oficiales y entérate de todo sobre Roblox y desarrollo.</p>

        <div class="links-list">
            <!-- Canal de WhatsApp -->
            <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbCnNJ7CHDyjJQFBq63T" target="_blank" class="link-btn whatsapp">
                <div class="link-content">
                    <span class="icon">💬</span>
                    <span>Canal de WhatsApp</span>
                </div>
                <span class="arrow">➔</span>
            </a>

            <!-- Servidor de Discord -->
            <a href="https://discord.gg/YGSashCBK" target="_blank" class="link-btn discord">
                <div class="link-content">
                    <span class="icon">🎧</span>
                    <span>Servidor de Discord</span>
                </div>
                <span class="arrow">➔</span>
            </a>

            <!-- Perfil de Roblox -->
            <a href="https://www.roblox.com/es/users/5423998178/profile" target="_blank" class="link-btn roblox">
                <div class="link-content">
                    <span class="icon">🎮</span>
                    <span>Perfil de Roblox</span>
                </div>
                <span class="arrow">➔</span>
            </a>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            Blox_sii • 2026
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
